<<playerCantMove Player>> <<setLIDAR RadarTriangle false>>
Bubby: Look, some fish! That means we're getting closer to my home, but it does mean I'll have to be careful when using SONAR.[pause=5000 /]
Bubby: SONAR can damage marine life if used nearby, especially animals like whales and dolphins that use high-frequency sounds to communicate or echolocate! Let's avoid using SONAR when there are other fish nearby![pause=8000 /]
<<playerCanMove Player>>
