title: Wrong_Clam
tags:
---
<<playerCantMove Player>> <<setLIDAR RadarTriangle false>> <<setSonar SonarPulse false>>
Bubby: I think I detect a clam up ahead! Let's see, is that Pearl?[pause=5000 /]
Bubby: Which of my sensors is the right tool to see if this clam is my friend Pearl?[pause=5000 /]
-> LIDAR!
    Bubby: Nope, not quite! LIDAR can give us a lot of information about the shape of an object, but won't give us details like color or writing![pause=5000 /]
    Bubby: In this scenario we need to use the light/camera because it allows us to see the details of an object and use our object recognition skills to determine if it's what we're looking for.[pause=8000 /]
-> SONAR!
    Bubby: Nope, not quite! SONAR can give us a lot of information about the location and some details about the shape of an object, but won't give us details like color or writing![pause=8000 /]
    Bubby: In this scenario we need to use the light/camera because it allows us to see the details of an object and use our object recognition skills to determine if it's what we're looking for.[pause=8000 /]
-> Your Light/Camera!
    Bubby: Yes, that's right! The light/camera allows us to see the actual colors and details of an object and use our object recognition skills to determine if it's what we're looking for.[pause=8000 /]
-> I don't know.
    Bubby: That's okay! In this scenario we need to use the light/camera because it allows us to see the details of an object and use our object recognition skills to determine if it's what we're looking for.[pause=8000 /]
<<cameraEnabled AnglerfishLight true>>
Bubby: Oh no, that isn't Pearl, she generally has her shell open a little unlike this clam. Let's follow the signs and find Pearl![pause=5000 /]
<<playerCanMove Player>> <<cameraEnabled AnglerfishLight false>>
===


title: Start_CAMERA
tags:
---
<<playerCantMove Player>> <<setLIDAR RadarTriangle false>> <<setSonar SonarPulse false>>
Bubby: We're almost home - this is the last area, the Sunken Shipyard! My home is very close to here![pause=5000 /]
Bubby: It looks like the pressure at this depth has caused the lights to fail on the signposts, so we'll need to get close and use my light to read the instructions on the signposts.[pause=8000 /]
Bubby: You can hold down the shift key to make my light expand so we can see better. But look out, using my light and my bad eyes to see drains my energy fastest of all![pause=8000 /]
Bubby: In other AI powered systems, cameras serve the same purpose as your eyes do when we light up the area - they can recognize objects and give us lots of details about what they see![pause=8000 /]
Bubby: Let's look for signposts, they'll tell us how to find my friend Pearl - she should know how to get us home from here! Let's go![pause=5000 /]
<<playerCanMove Player>>
===

